{
 "id": "rewrite+spend/extract-llm-sweep/fallback-ask-fresh-input/5m",
 "description": "The sweep's ask could not read the cached prefix (after a restart the proxy holds no previous body), so it falls back to a call that pays the whole 18,500-token transcript plus the 400-token question as fresh input: 18,900 x $3.00 + 200 x $15.00 per million = -$0.05970. The ask drops two outputs, and the next cold request removes 7,900 + 1,950 = 9,850 tokens as writes, +$0.03694, as two spans of one change. The sweep nets -$0.02276: with the prefix the same ask would have cost -$0.00945 (see rewrite+spend/extract-llm-sweep/ask-then-cold-apply/5m).",
